From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:09:02 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 407/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0406: own the
 iOS audio session in the Voice hook

The audio session was entered and left from the Voice store, so the new-chat start path released it when the start page unmounted, leaving a Voice chat that restored the session, and a plain snapshot read pinned it. It is now a reference count held by each mounted Voice chat through useAeVoiceMode; the start tap (new-chat Voice button, Voice switch) holds it inside the tap and the chat's hook adopts that hold, which expires after 30 seconds if no chat does. Leaving a Voice chat restores, and one chat turning Voice off no longer restores while another is on.
